class.description:
This is an abstract class. On its own, it doesn't do anything, but it can be extended to hold data related to the chosen rendering method (see [TileMapGaeaMaterial] and [GridMapGaeaMaterial]), or to select sub-materials programatically (see [PointwiseRandomGaeaMaterial]).
For example, a material that chooses between 2 materials depending on the value of the point of a [GaeaSample] could look like this:
[codeblock]
extends GaeaMaterial

@export var material_1: GaeaMaterial
@export var material_2: GaeaMaterial

func _is_data():
	return false


func _is_sampled():
	return true


func _get_sampled_resource(rng, value):
	return material_1 if value == 1.0 else material_2
[/codeblock]
